          "type": "input",
          "title": "You'll want to know: চুলকানো",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "চুলকানো — chulkāno — \"to scratch\"."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 2,
          "type": "etymology",
          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "CDIAL has no row for চুলকানো (chulkāno), but it appears to belong with cul, \"fidget, itch\", a form CDIAL reconstructs; under it CDIAL lists Hindi cul, \"itching\", and culculānā, \"to itch\", and Bengali culculiyā, \"restless\" (CDIAL 4874)."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
